---
layout: base.njk
permalink: "map.html"
title: CA Sea Change Atlas — coverage map
ogImage: /img/preview-map.png
description: A Leaflet map of California sea-level-rise tool coverage, with live flood-hazard overlays from BCDC, USGS CoSMoS, NOAA, and FEMA, and click-to-inspect flood data.
nav: map
bodyClass: map-page
leaflet: true
mapModuleEntry: /js/map/index.js
footerAttribution: >
  Coverage boundaries: county/state data from the
  <a href="https://github.com/plotly/datasets" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Plotly <code>datasets</code> repository</a>
  (MIT license), originally derived from U.S. Census TIGER data — full provenance in
  <a href="/ca-sea-change-atlas/data/coverage/ATTRIBUTION.md">data/coverage/ATTRIBUTION.md</a>. Flood-depth overlay: live map layers from
  <a href="https://explorer.adaptingtorisingtides.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BCDC's Adapting to Rising Tides Bay Shoreline Flood Explorer</a> —
  planning-level only, not for parcel-scale, permitting, or engineering use; see
  <a href="https://explorer.adaptingtorisingtides.org/about/a-disclaimer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">their full disclaimer</a>.
  CoSMoS flood extent: live data from
  <a href="https://www.usgs.gov/centers/pcmsc/science/coastal-storm-modeling-system-cosmos" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USGS CoSMoS / Our Coast, Our Future</a>.
  Sea level rise and coastal flood exposure layers: live data from
  <a href="https://coast.noaa.gov/slr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NOAA's Sea Level Rise Viewer</a> and
  <a href="https://coast.noaa.gov/digitalcoast/tools/flood-exposure.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Coastal Flood Exposure Mapper</a>.
  Flood zones: live effective-data-only layer from
  <a href="https://www.fema.gov/flood-maps/national-flood-hazard-layer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FEMA's National Flood Hazard Layer</a> —
  see the layer panel for the effective-vs-preliminary caveat.
  Base map &copy; <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors. Address search via
  <a href="https://nominatim.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap Nominatim</a>. Full license list:
  <a href="/ca-sea-change-atlas/licenses.html">Licenses & sources</a>.
---
<div class="map-toolbar">
<span class="topbar-disclaimer">Unofficial tool — verify before relying on this for planning decisions.</span>
<form class="search-form" id="searchForm">
<input type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="Search an address or place in California…" autocomplete="off">
<button type="submit">Search</button>
</form>
</div>
<div class="search-status" id="searchStatus"></div>

<div class="map-layout">
<div id="map"></div>
<aside class="layer-panel">
<h2>Layers</h2>

<div class="layer-group">
<div class="layer-group-title collapsible-title">
<button type="button" class="group-collapse-btn" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="coverageGroupBody">▾</button>
<span>Tool coverage areas</span>
</div>
<div class="layer-group-body" id="coverageGroupBody">
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" data-layer="bay-area-counties" checked><span class="swatch" data-swatch="bay-area-counties"></span>Bay Area counties <em>(BCDC ART, East CC Flood Explorer)</em></label>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" data-layer="east-contra-costa" checked><span class="swatch swatch-dashed" data-swatch="east-contra-costa"></span>East Contra Costa study area <em>(approximate)</em></label>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" data-layer="california-state" checked><span class="swatch" data-swatch="california-state"></span>California statewide tools <em>(Cal-Adapt, CoSMoS, CREST)</em></label>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" data-layer="national" checked><span class="swatch swatch-dashed" data-swatch="national"></span>National tools <em>(CA portion shown)</em></label>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" data-layer="orange-county" checked><span class="swatch" data-swatch="orange-county"></span>Orange County / Newport Bay <em>(FloodRISE)</em></label>
</div>
</div>

<div class="layer-group">
<div class="layer-group-title bcdc-title-row">
<button type="button" class="group-collapse-btn" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="bcdcGroupBody">▾</button>
<span>BCDC Flood Explorer <em>(Bay Shoreline Flood Explorer)</em></span>
<button type="button" id="hideAllBcdc" class="hide-all-btn">Hide all</button>
</div>

<div class="layer-group-body" id="bcdcGroupBody">
<p class="click-hint">Click the map to see values at that point for the layers checked below.</p>

<div class="mode-tabs" role="tablist">
<button type="button" class="mode-tab active" data-mode="level" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Total Water Level</button>
<button type="button" class="mode-tab" data-mode="scenario" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Choose a Scenario</button>
</div>

<div class="mode-panel" id="modeLevel">
<label for="floodLevel">Total water level, MHHW+</label>
<div class="level-row">
<input type="range" id="floodLevel" min="0" max="10" step="1" value="3">
<span id="floodLevelValue" class="overlay-level-value">36"</span>
</div>
<p class="equiv-caption" id="equivCaption"></p>
<div class="equiv-scenarios" id="equivScenarios"></div>
</div>

<div class="mode-panel" id="modeScenario" hidden>
<div class="scenario-block">
<div class="scenario-label">Sea level rise</div>
<div class="btn-grid" id="slrButtons"></div>
</div>
<div class="scenario-block">
<div class="scenario-label">Storm surge</div>
<div class="btn-grid" id="stormButtons"></div>
</div>
<p class="scenario-result" id="scenarioResult">Select a sea level rise and storm surge amount to see the closest matching Total Water Level.</p>
</div>

<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" data-bcdc-layer="inundation"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="bcdc-inundation"></span>Depth of Flooding</label>

<div class="mode-tabs" role="tablist">
<button type="button" class="impact-tab active" data-impact="flooding" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Flooding</button>
<button type="button" class="impact-tab" data-impact="consequence" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Consequence</button>
</div>

<div class="mode-panel" id="impactFlooding">
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" data-bcdc-layer="overtopping"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="bcdc-overtopping"></span>Shoreline Overtopping</label>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" data-bcdc-layer="lowlying"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="bcdc-lowlying"></span>Disconnected Low-lying Areas</label>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" data-static-layer="legaldelta"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="legaldelta"></span>Legal Delta boundary</label>
</div>

<div class="mode-panel" id="impactConsequence" hidden>
<label for="consequenceSelect" class="scenario-label">Consequence category, at the current water level</label>
<select id="consequenceSelect">
<option value="">None</option>
<option value="highway_vehicle">Transportation — vehicle traffic (currently unavailable)</option>
<option value="highway_truck">Transportation — truck traffic (currently unavailable)</option>
<option value="rail">Transportation — rail (currently unavailable)</option>
<option value="recreation">Natural lands — recreation</option>
<option value="tidalhabitat">Natural lands — tidal marsh / habitat</option>
<option value="housing">Future growth — housing</option>
<option value="jobs">Future growth — jobs</option>
<option value="vulcom_social">Vulnerable communities — social</option>
<option value="vulcom_contam">Vulnerable communities — contamination</option>
</select>
<p class="scenario-result" id="consequenceNote"></p>
</div>

<div class="bcdc-legend" id="bcdcLegend" hidden></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="layer-group">
<div class="layer-group-title collapsible-title">
<button type="button" class="group-collapse-btn" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="cosmosGroupBody">▾</button>
<span>CoSMoS Flood Explorer <em>(USGS Our Coast, Our Future)</em></span>
</div>
<div class="layer-group-body" id="cosmosGroupBody">
<p class="click-hint" id="cosmosClickHint">Click the map to see modeled values for the selected scenario, where available.</p>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" id="cosmosToggle">Show CoSMoS layer</label>

<label for="cosmosRegionSelect" class="scenario-label">Scenario region</label>
<select id="cosmosRegionSelect"></select>

<label for="cosmosTopicSelect" class="scenario-label">Scenario topic</label>
<select id="cosmosTopicSelect"></select>

<div id="cosmosExtraControls"></div>

<div class="scenario-block">
<div class="scenario-label">Sea Level Rise, <span id="cosmosSlrValue">0 cm</span></div>
<input type="range" id="cosmosSlrSlider" min="0" max="0" step="1" value="0">
</div>

<div class="scenario-block">
<div class="scenario-label">Storm Frequency</div>
<div class="btn-grid" id="cosmosStormButtons"></div>
</div>

<p class="scenario-result" id="cosmosResult"></p>
<div class="bcdc-legend" id="cosmosLegend" hidden></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="layer-group">
<div class="layer-group-title collapsible-title">
<button type="button" class="group-collapse-btn" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="noaaSlrGroupBody">▾</button>
<span>NOAA Sea Level Rise Viewer</span>
</div>
<div class="layer-group-body" id="noaaSlrGroupBody">
<p class="click-hint">Click the map to see whether a point falls within a mapped low-lying area at the selected sea level.</p>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" id="noaaSlrToggle"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="noaa-slr"></span>Show sea level rise layer</label>
<div class="scenario-block">
<div class="scenario-label">Sea Level Rise, <span id="noaaSlrValue">3 ft</span></div>
<input type="range" id="noaaSlrSlider" min="0" max="20" step="1" value="6">
</div>
<p class="scenario-result" id="noaaSlrResult"></p>

<p class="click-hint">Click the map to see the nearest tide station's high tide flooding thresholds — today's thresholds, not tied to the sea level rise amount above.</p>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" id="noaaHtfToggle"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="noaa-htf"></span>High Tide Flooding stations</label>
</div>
</div>

<div class="layer-group">
<div class="layer-group-title collapsible-title">
<button type="button" class="group-collapse-btn" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="femaGroupBody">▾</button>
<span>FEMA Flood Zones <em>(National Flood Hazard Layer)</em></span>
</div>
<div class="layer-group-body" id="femaGroupBody">
<p class="click-hint">Click the map to see the FEMA flood zone at that point.</p>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" id="femaToggle"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="fema"></span>Flood Hazard Zones (effective)</label>
<p class="scenario-result" id="femaResult"></p>
<p class="click-hint">Shows FEMA's effective flood hazard data only, not including preliminary or pending map updates.</p>
<div class="bcdc-legend" id="femaLegend" hidden></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="layer-group">
<div class="layer-group-title collapsible-title">
<button type="button" class="group-collapse-btn" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="cfemGroupBody">▾</button>
<span>NOAA Coastal Flood Exposure Mapper</span>
</div>
<div class="layer-group-body" id="cfemGroupBody">
<p class="click-hint">Click the map to see which mapped hazards overlap at that point (FEMA zones, high tide flooding, sea level rise, storm surge, tsunami run-up).</p>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" id="cfemToggle"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="cfem"></span>Flood hazard overlap</label>

<p class="click-hint">Scales are shown below; click-to-inspect isn't available for this layer.</p>
<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" id="cfemSurgeToggle"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="cfem-surge"></span>Hurricane storm surge (Southern California only)</label>
<div id="cfemSurgeCategoryButtons" class="btn-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);"></div>
<p class="scenario-result" id="cfemSurgeResult">Only Category 1–2 storm surge is mapped, and only for Southern California (San Diego north to around Point Conception) — NOAA's own National Hurricane Center service has no data further north or for higher categories.</p>
<div class="bcdc-legend" id="cfemSurgeLegend" hidden></div>

<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" id="cfemHtfToggle"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="cfem-htf"></span>High Tide Flooding (CFEM's own layer)</label>
<div class="bcdc-legend" id="cfemHtfLegend" hidden></div>

<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" id="cfemFemaToggle"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="cfem-fema"></span>FEMA Flood Zones (CFEM's own layer)</label>
<div class="bcdc-legend" id="cfemFemaLegend" hidden></div>

<label class="layer-item"><input type="checkbox" id="cfemTsunamiToggle"><span class="swatch" data-swatch="cfem-tsunami"></span>Tsunami run-up areas</label>
<div class="bcdc-legend" id="cfemTsunamiLegend" hidden></div>
</div>
</div>
</aside>
</div>
